1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:14,288
Writing, task one. Form number 4. You want a part-time job in a supermarket. Answer the questions in the application. Answer in a full sentence, at least ten words.

2
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:17,594
What work have you done before?

3
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:34,948
For two years I worked as a shop assistant in a grocery store and stocked the shelves.

4
00:00:35,833 --> 00:00:39,647
Why do you want to work in our supermarket?

5
00:00:50,033 --> 00:00:57,388
I want to work for you because the supermarket is close and I'm looking for a part-time job.

6
00:00:58,300 --> 00:01:00,558
When can you work?

7
00:01:10,967 --> 00:01:17,555
I can work Monday to Friday in the afternoon and every other Saturday all day.

8
00:01:18,467 --> 00:01:28,306
Fill in form 4 on the Zkouška A2 nanečisto website. The link is in the video description. And subscribe — a new video every day.
